# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere, on every platform.
# Prettier checks LF, and the golden test compares the fixture ledger byte-for-byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Ledger / fixture files are evidence: never rewrite their bytes.
*.jsonl -text

# Binaries
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
